{"step_index":138,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:09:42Z","input_tokens":2432,"cache_read_tokens":121034,"output_tokens":1428,"thinking":"Initial assessment: Need to incorporate policy checks into the threat detection logic. Processes blocked by policy or connecting to blocked IPs should immediately trigger a critical alert.\n\nRevised logic: Added a policy check at the beginning of the threat assessment. If the process is blocked according to the policy engine, the threat score is immediately set to critical. Also, the revised code checks for connections to blocked IPs.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"c:\\Users\\thann\\Downloads\\AntiGravity\\SpywareProcessMon\\backend\\detector.py","Replacement":"        # ==============================================================\n        # PASS 8: Access Control & Allow/Block Policy Enforcement\n        # ==============================================================\n        is_blocked = self.policy_engine.is_process_blocked(name, exe_path)\n        has_blocked_ip_conn = any(\n            self.policy_engine.is_ip_blocked(c.get(\"remote_ip\", \"\"))\n            for c in network_summary.get(\"connections\", [])\n        )\n        is_allowed = self.policy_engine.is_process_allowed(name, exe_path)\n\n        if is_blocked:\n            threat_score = 100\n            categories.add(\"Blacklisted Policy Violation\")\n            reasons.insert(0, {\n                \"vector\": \"Policy Blacklist Enforcement\",\n                \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\",\n                \"score\": 100,\n                \"detail\": f\"Process '{name}' is explicitly banned by administrator security policy.\"\n            })\n\n        if has_blocked_ip_conn:\n            threat_score = 100\n            categories.add(\"Banned IP Communication\")\n            reasons.insert(0, {\n                \"vector\": \"Blocked IP Connection\",\n                \"severity\": \"